# One project per line:  <name> = <git-url>
# - <name> becomes the Lima VM name (a-z, 0-9, hyphen).
# - <git-url> is cloned into ~/code/<name>/ inside the VM. Use SSH form so the
#   forwarded macOS SSH agent handles auth.
# Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Copy this to projects.list and edit. projects.list is gitignored.

# example   = git@github.com:you/example.git
# blog      = git@github.com:you/blog.git
